            }
          ]
        },
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$p=\\frac47$.\n\nSet the next-draw red probability equal to the limiting probability.",
          "worked": "At the limit, the probabilities of using the red and blue boxes are $p$ and $1-p$. The next draw has the same red probability $p$.\n$$\\begin{align*}p&=\\frac34p+\\frac13(1-p)\\\\12p&=9p+4(1-p)\\\\12p&=5p+4\\\\7p&=4\\\\p&=\\frac47.\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 31
      }
    ]
